# 💄 Beauty Products Analysis Dashboard

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing beauty and skincare products using Power BI to uncover key consumer trends, product performance, and brand insights. The dashboard transforms raw data into interactive visualizations to support data-driven decision-making.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

* Identify the most used beauty product categories
* Analyze product frequency across brands
* Evaluate customer ratings and satisfaction levels
* Discover trends based on gender, skin type, and pricing

---

## 📊 Key Insights

* **Serum** is the most frequently used product category
* Skincare products outperform makeup products in usage
* A few brands dominate product frequency, indicating strong market presence
* Customer ratings vary significantly across brands
* Mid-range brands maintain consistent and stable ratings

---

## 📈 Dashboard Features

* Category-wise product analysis
* Brand performance and frequency tracking
* Rating distribution visualization
* Interactive filters:

  * Brand
  * Gender
  * Skin Type
  * Category
  * Product Size
  * Price Range

---

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

* Power BI
* DAX (Data Analysis Expressions)
* Data Cleaning & Transformation

---

## 📂 Dataset

The dataset includes:

* Product categories
* Brand information
* Customer ratings & reviews
* Pricing details
* Product attributes (skin type, gender, size)

---

## 🚀 How to Use

1. Download the Power BI (.pbix) file from this repository
2. Open it using Power BI Desktop
3. Use filters to explore different insights
4. Interact with visuals to analyze trends

---

## 💡 Business Value

* Helps identify high-demand product categories
* Supports brand performance comparison
* Assists in improving product quality
* Enables better marketing and pricing strategies

